{"4012880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Undead Sands: Stolen Future ☢️ ", "steam_appid": 4012880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNDEAD SANDS: Stolen Future </strong>☢️<strong>   </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012880/extras/1a91d56b1196354a725a13162d7fb8ca.avif?t=1758979601\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=✪=  In the blazing deserts of North Africa, the Third Reich ✙ has unleashed a terrifying new weapon: — ☢ a mutagen that twists  man and beast into horrors that stalk the sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  ✪ In &quot;<strong>UNDEAD SANDS: Stolen Future </strong>☢️&quot;, a <strong>turn-based tactical strategy RPG</strong>, You lead the last surviving squad of battle-hardened <strong>commandos</strong> in a war-torn wasteland to seize the enemy's ultimate weapon: a <strong>Time Machine</strong> that twisted the present. Uncover a sinister plot, infiltrate heavily guarded bases, and journey through <strong>past</strong> and <strong>future</strong> to rewrite history. Strategy, stealth, and sacrifice are your only hope to set things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012880/extras/68c462ced37316f66d800f8ad79bc939.poster.avif?t=1758979601\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012880/extras/68c462ced37316f66d800f8ad79bc939.webm?t=1758979601\" ty