/strong> is yours to explore—navigate treacherous dunes, uncover hidden missions, and face special encounters that test your grit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With isometric sprite-based HD graphics, a lean learning curve, and an intuitive interface, you’ll command with precision through fog of war and dynamic zoom controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the gritty charm of Fallout Tactics and the tactical brilliance of Commandos, this indie solo-developer passion project delivers a raw, unforgiving experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carve a legend in the sands, or become another bleached skull under the merciless sun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=★= <strong>Project Status:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:      ███████░░░   70%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design:    █████░░░░░ 60%  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Graphics  █████░░░░░ 50%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Code:       ██░░░░░░░░ 20% </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🛠 Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isometric sprite-based HD graphics for a retro yet sharp visual edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world filled with danger, secrets, and opportunity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Creation &amp; PERKS to forge your unique squad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of war for tense, tactical decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions and special encounters that keep you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive interface and lean learning curve for seamless strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom controls to survey the battlefield with precision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ᯓ★ Lead. Fight. Survive. The desert doesn’t forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\